 Secure Configuration.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-08-21\nValid as Of: 2025-08-21\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 229 ---\nComponent: SAP Omnichannel Promotion Pricing\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New GET Endpoints for the Calculation and Data Upload Services\nDescription: You can use two new GET endpoints for the Calculation and Data Upload services to verify that the connection is established successfully.  For more information, see Calculation and Data Upload.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-08-21\nValid as Of: 2025-08-21\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 230 ---\nComponent: SAP Omnichannel Promotion Pricing\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Rate Limiting in SAP Omnichannel Promotion Pricing\nDescription: SAP Omnichannel Promotion Pricing uses rate limiting to prevent an overload of requests and ensure consistent availability of its services.  For more information, see Rate Limiting in SAP Omnichannel Promotion Pricing.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-08-21\nValid as Of: 2025-08-21\nVersion: Cloud\n\n"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_4d8f0f40317eed8acd992fb58554455984e02c98b6c315d8aba585f3c6eb4c25_v2"}